# kotlin value shape questions (is-null, is-present, is-text, type-of), through the shape runtime shim (runtime/shape.kt). Internal: shared modules reach it through `@term/base/native/{platform}/shape` and call its tasks by name. native/kotlin/text.tree keeps its own dock.

dock load
  load <global:shape>, name shape

# Each task below is one call to the shim it keeps, so a caller finds the task by name and never the dock alias
# (decision 146 point 1).

# whether the value is present, not null
task is-present
  take value, like unknown
  like boolean
  send back
    call shape/is-present
      bind value, read value

# whether the value is text
task is-text
  take value, like unknown
  like boolean
  send back
    call shape/is-text
      bind value, read value

# whether the value is null
task is-null
  take value, like unknown
  like boolean
  send back
    call shape/is-null
      bind value, read value

# the value's type in Term's words: null, list, text, boolean, number or object
task type-of
  take value, like unknown
  like text
  send back
    call shape/type-of
      bind value, read value
